{
  "id": "center_of_gravity",
  "title": "Center of Gravity",
  "description": "Calculate the center of gravity for various shapes including triangles, parallelograms, trapezoids, and systems of two bodies.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Center of Gravity Calculator\n\nThe \"center of gravity\" for a volume, an area or a line is the point at which the body - if suspended - would be in balance.\n\nFor a symmetrical body in a uniform material - the center of gravity would be in the geometric center.\n\n### Formulas\n\n**Triangle:** a = h / 3\n\n**Perimeter:** d = h (b + c) / 2 (a + b + c)\n\n**Two Bodies:** \n- b = Q a / (P + Q)\n- c = P a / (P + Q)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "shape",
          "label": "Shape Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Triangle",
              "value": "triangle"
            },
            {
              "label": "Perimeter",
              "value": "perimeter"
            },
            {
              "label": "Two Bodies",
              "value": "two_bodies"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "triangle"
        },
        {
          "id": "h",
          "label": "Height (h)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "a",
          "label": "Distance (a)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "label": "Side b",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "label": "Side c",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "P",
          "label": "Mass/Weight P",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg",
          "defaultValue": 10
        },
        {
          "id": "Q",
          "label": "Mass/Weight Q",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg",
          "defaultValue": 5
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "triangle_cog",
          "label": "Triangle Center of Gravity (a)",
          "formula": "inputs.h / 3",
          "unit": "m",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "perimeter_cog",
          "label": "Perimeter Center of Gravity (d)",
          "formula": "inputs.h * (inputs.b + inputs.c) / (2 * (inputs.a + inputs.b + inputs.c))",
          "unit": "m",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "two_bodies_b",
          "label": "Two Bodies Distance b",
          "formula": "inputs.Q * inputs.a / (inputs.P + inputs.Q)",
          "unit": "m",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "two_bodies_c",
          "label": "Two Bodies Distance c",
          "formula": "inputs.P * inputs.a / (inputs.P + inputs.Q)",
          "unit": "m",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Shape Type",
        "Formula",
        "Result",
        "Unit"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Triangle",
          "a = h / 3",
          "inputs.h / 3",
          "m"
        ],
        [
          "Perimeter",
          "d = h(b+c)/2(a+b+c)",
          "inputs.h * (inputs.b + inputs.c) / (2 * (inputs.a + inputs.b + inputs.c))",
          "m"
        ],
        [
          "Two Bodies - Distance b",
          "b = Q·a / (P+Q)",
          "inputs.Q * inputs.a / (inputs.P + inputs.Q)",
          "m"
        ],
        [
          "Two Bodies - Distance c",
          "c = P·a / (P+Q)",
          "inputs.P * inputs.a / (inputs.P + inputs.Q)",
          "m"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}